1
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:03,455
On Monday you were twenty-three.

2
00:00:03,475 --> 00:00:05,877
It's Friday, and you're twenty-eight.

3
00:00:05,897 --> 00:00:08,843
Because you ignored five of Mum's calls.

4
00:00:08,863 --> 00:00:10,743
In this world, every call from your

5
00:00:10,763 --> 00:00:12,943
mum that you ignore makes you one year

6
00:00:12,963 --> 00:00:13,705
older.

7
00:00:15,654 --> 00:00:17,009
It started small.

8
00:00:17,029 --> 00:00:18,709
A missed call in a meeting.

9
00:00:18,729 --> 00:00:19,924
Twenty-four.

10
00:00:19,944 --> 00:00:21,485
A call during football.

11
00:00:21,505 --> 00:00:22,499
Twenty-five.

12
00:00:22,519 --> 00:00:23,274
Her birthday.

13
00:00:23,294 --> 00:00:24,259
You were busy.

14
00:00:24,279 --> 00:00:25,354
Three calls.

15
00:00:25,374 --> 00:00:26,419
Twenty-eight.

16
00:00:26,439 --> 00:00:27,694
Your knees click now.

17
00:00:27,714 --> 00:00:29,703
Your back hurts when you stand.

18
00:00:29,723 --> 00:00:31,328
Your friends think you've been working

19
00:00:31,348 --> 00:00:32,307
too hard.

20
00:00:33,957 --> 00:00:35,451
Then the calls stop.

21
00:00:35,471 --> 00:00:36,501
A whole week.

22
00:00:36,521 --> 00:00:37,298
Not one.

23
00:00:37,318 --> 00:00:38,958
You should feel relieved.

24
00:00:38,978 --> 00:00:40,621
You're not getting any older.

25
00:00:40,641 --> 00:00:42,900
But your phone has never been this quiet.

26
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:44,205
So you call her.

27
00:00:44,225 --> 00:00:44,880
It rings.

28
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:45,895
And rings.

29
00:00:45,915 --> 00:00:46,878
Voicemail.

30
00:00:49,228 --> 00:00:51,248
You take the first train home.

31
00:00:51,268 --> 00:00:52,473
Mum is in the garden.

32
00:00:52,493 --> 00:00:54,149
Her phone is in the kitchen.

33
00:00:54,169 --> 00:00:55,231
On silent.

34
00:00:55,251 --> 00:00:55,926
Oh!

35
00:00:55,966 --> 00:00:57,613
I didn't want to bother you anymore.

36
00:00:57,633 --> 00:00:58,333
Bother me.

37
00:00:58,353 --> 00:00:59,093
Please.

38
00:00:59,113 --> 00:00:59,993
Every day.

39
00:01:00,543 --> 00:01:01,823
You don't get any younger.

40
00:01:01,843 --> 00:01:03,652
That's not how it works.

41
00:01:03,672 --> 00:01:05,542
But from now on, you pick up on the

42
00:01:05,562 --> 00:01:06,781
first ring.

43
00:01:06,801 --> 00:01:08,656
When did you last answer on the first

44
00:01:08,676 --> 00:01:09,262
ring?
